                "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued October 15 at 4:30AM EDT by NWS Jacksonville FL",
                "description": "Patchy to areas fog will continue through sunrise across portions\nof much of southeast Georgia and northeast Florida. Patchy dense\nfog will likely develop with visibilities on area roadways\nreduced to a quarter of a mile at times. Slow down and use caution\non the roadways if commuting this morning. The fog should lift\nbetween 9 and 10 AM.",
